        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/bb73d2/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2012-10-26T05:14:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yes. It says the five targets with the lowest HP, not the five targets with the lowest HP and are below their maximum. If Unity is out, her mechs waste some of the healing. If you're fighting The Matriarch, that Environment isn't doing anything.</p>",
